WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.780
Well, you see...

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:14.270
I want to make a short pamphlet that 
introduces the members of the club.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.780
What do you mean?

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:20.120
Something about half this size.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:25.610
I'd like you all to write a profile,
and if you can, submit a drawing.

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:29.800
We'll make copies and give them 
to all the members of Genshiken.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.160
I know you guys already 
know each other, but...

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:38.640
I see! In other words, you 
want to bring back <i>Mebaetame</i>!

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.950
<i>Mebaetame</i>?

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:43.360
No, nothing that big.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:48.370
Genshiken's club magazine! I don't think 
we've made one for a long time, though.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:49.070
<b><i>Mebaetame</i></b>

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.780
I've made a profile for myself 
to give you an example.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.040
That's pretty good!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:27.290
<b>Chika Ogiue 
 (Naruyuki Ogino)    
 Favorite Anime: 
Fullmetal Sorcerer 
Kujibiki Unbalance 
 Attack on Rhea</b>

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.710
You work fast!

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:38.650
<b>An Ogiue beyond any other that 
man's history has ever known! {Source: The major's speech in hellsing ultimate. Pulled from wikiquote.}</b>

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:33.300
Funz!

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.780
I don't get it. What kind of Ogiue?

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.650
It sounds like you, anyway.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:42.600
I see. Then in my case...

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.840
Of course, I draw everything from 
originals to copyrighted characters.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:51.280
I think "Lord and Servant" and "Over 
Fifty” yaoi has roots in historical novels.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:56.630
Ikegami Shouichiro is a personal favorite,
especially his <i>Tale of Sanada</i>.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.940
Okay. I think you should write about that.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.310
I'm looking forward to
seeing yours, Yajima-san.

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:03.280
Why?

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:06.490
Um, well... you look like 
you'd be a good artist.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:07.990
Don't judge me like that.

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.790
I'm sorry.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:15.070
But didn't you say you drew when you joined?

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:18.850
I said I drew. I didn't say I drew well.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:22.390
So I'll make it clear now: I suck.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:25.280
Of course, that doesn't matter.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:29.350
I'll set the deadline 
for, oh, a week from now.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.990
When you're done, give it to me.

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:33.560
Okay!

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:38.460
U-Um... I'm sorry.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:43.410
No, don't worry. I'm glad I got it out there. 
I wouldn't want people expecting anything.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.350
Okay.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:46.200
Yajimacchi! Yajimacchi!

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.120
Can I go to your place today?

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.210
We can draw ours together!

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:56.460
<i>Cross Over My Legs</i>. {This is a reference to a mediocre playstation/psp RPG.  How mediocre, you ask?  So mediocre it was never translated, when every piece of crap they could find to throw on the PSP was coming over.}

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.040
This'll do, I guess.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:04.330
That's a bit much. Why do you need so much?

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:06.570
I eat a lot, even though I'm thin.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.410
I don't care! Are you making fun of me?

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:11.320
Hato-chan, anything else you want?

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.450
No.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:16.400
But, well... can I really come too?

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:21.370
Sure!  We're all in the same 
circle, so let's get along!

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:22.870
It's my house, though.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.410
I wish Sue-san could've come.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.250
She refused.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.540
Found one!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.740
Right, right. Of course you did.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:42.340
I see. So you're into <i>Champ</i> manga 
series and collect doujinshi for them.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.580
Well, it's had a big effect on my life.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.690
Is this desk where you draw?

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.060
Well, not just that.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.150
But I haven't opened all the boxes yet.

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:58.550
I never thought I'd have a man 
in here right after I moved in.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.920
I never even imagined it.

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:05.440
Okay, time for some girl talk!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.030
What about our profiles?

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.250
We can do that some other time.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:12.330
Let's hear about how much you love <i>Champ</i>. {Champ in this case is Jump, so like Naruto and One Piece and... whatever else runs in Jump. I'm not even sure.}

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.040
So in <i>Two Piece</i>, are you into Zora x Yon?

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:19.270
No, I normally like Ukki on top with 
anybody... wait, what are we talking about?

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.380
Rotten girl talk!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.970
So let's have a toast!

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:24.580
Cheers.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:25.840
Cheers.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:31.350
Come on! It's not like you'll lose anything.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.880
No, I've got my pantyhose on.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:37.650
Just take them off in the bathroom! 
I just want to touch you a little!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.220
But...

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:42.180
Just think to yourself that we're all women, 
and there's nothing weird about it at all!

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:45.080
It's important to get to 
know each other better!

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.860
What's going on here?

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.880
I think I actually ended up having fun.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:10.340
She looks like she's had 
more fun than anything.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:16.870
And of course, we didn't write anything. 
Why we even came here, I don't know.

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:23.420
Oh well. It's nice to have another 
friend who's a rotten girl.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:32.270
No, wait! That's no girl!

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.490
But that was a girl's voice 
I heard when she was sleeping.

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:40.270
No, no! I just forgot, and that's a guy!

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:45.550
Oh no. I was sleeping next to a guy!

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:51.290
Just wait. In the morning, 
she'll need a shave.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:55.130
Wait, she said she plucked them.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.360
How soft and supple!

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:07.240
I couldn't feel any pores at all! 
Did she use the Smooth-Smooth Fruit? {Funi translation of a one piece term.}

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.740
It's smooth! She ate 
the Smooth-Smooth Fruit!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:17.830
Shut up.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.540
You should touch her too, Yajimacchi.

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:27.550
No way in hell!

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.680
Why is it so different?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:42.300
Well, I do it every morning and every night.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:45.520
I wash my face with facial lotion, 
beauty lotion, and milk lotion.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.110
You need to do it every single
day, or it doesn't work.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:51.950
I never do anything for my skin! 
And I almost never wear makeup!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.280
I pluck out the hair when I bathe.

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:57.450
I work up a lather on my whole 
body, then I use an epilator.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:02.870
But it really hurts in some places, doesn't it? 
Especially the bikini area.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:06.410
I only ever shave my armpits for summer!

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.050
Oh no!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:12.180
I always thought since I was 
an otaku, it didn't matter!

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:15.560
But because of her, something 
is falling apart inside of me!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:23.020
No. Maybe she's actually a girl!

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:27.660
She'd have to be! "Someone this cute can't 
be a girl!" only happens in H-games.

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:31.650
It doesn't matter what Kuchiki-sempai says, 
there's no such things as miracles!

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:35.970
That wig, that male voice... 
those were both fake!

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:38.590
She's just someone who's getting 
off to a weird start in college!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:42.100
I'm just looking. If she's 
a man she won't care,

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.870
and if she's a girl then there's 
really no problem at all!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:49.630
Wait. If she really is a guy, then 
aren't I totally pathetic?

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:53.980
I need to see. I just 
need to take a quick look!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.850
What are you doing, Yajimacchi?

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.560
Nothing, really.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:07.150
You're flipping up the skirt of a rotten 
boy? How much of a pervert are you?

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:11.620
Well, you see... I wanted to 
know if she was really a guy.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:13.280
I know how you feel.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:18.450
But you need to wake me up before 
you do something fun like this!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.090
Hello.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.160
You're early today.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:36.360
Yes. My lecture ended early.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:39.160
So I went to Madarame-sempai's room early.

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.730
I see.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.400
Hmph! Hmph!

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:46.940
I'm so sorry!

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.230
Hello there.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:48.390
Hi there.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:49.530
Hello.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:51.300
Do you really understand?

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:55.060
I'm really sorry. I just 
totally forgot about you!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:57.270
I'll redo the layout later!

00:09:57.270 --> 00:10:00.790
Ogiue-san, that doesn't help.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.320
Hmph!

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:05.760
Um, this is my profile for the magazine.

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:07.560
Okay, thanks.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.620
Here's mine.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.480
Okay.

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:16.310
That's really something.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.130
Thank you.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:25.020
<b>Hato Kenjiro   
 Favorite Works 
 Dorarara! 
 Evangeleo Theatrical Edition 
 Hetarira 
 Winter Wars 
 Fuyume's Book of Friends 
 Sweets Basket    
 When You Cry</b>

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.380
Hato...

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:25.020
How far are you trying to go?

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:41.120
What's wrong? You look uneasy.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.870
I do not--

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:48.340
Hello? Thanks for calling.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.050
Yes.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:54.800
Yes. Thank you! Yes. Yes.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:11:00.320
Yes. All right. Thank you again.

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:03.010
Ogiue-san?

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:06.110
Well, actually...

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:11.350
The editor accepted my one-shot manga.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:14.800
Does that mean you're 
going to be in a magazine?

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:16.610
Yes.

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:18.970
Congratulations!

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.280
Wow.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.260
Thank you.

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:24.490
I don't know how many times we fought...

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.740
You and Sasahara-san, right?

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.610
Why don't you give him a call?

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:33.960
No, he's at work. I'll just send him a text.

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:38.880
Some people here really can get 
published. College is so amazing.

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:41.750
What a great response!

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.010
Yeah, thank you. Thanks for your help.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:51.470
They'll run part one in the September 
edition and part two in October.

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:56.980
The deadlines are 7/12 and 8/12.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.610
August?

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.570
Yes. I didn't realize until I said it.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:07.330
I don't know if we made it or not,

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.600
but that's right before 
Comic Festival, isn't it?

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:16.600
W-What did you say? All the new 
kids went to Ogichin's room?

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:20.470
Yes. They're going to help 
Ogiue as her assistants.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:24.240
They said they needed to move the schedule 
way up, or they wouldn't make it.

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:26.390
Oh no! She'll steal my harem!

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.260
Don't you dare go.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:31.600
Anyway, Kuchiki-kun, are 
you looking for a job?

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:32.580
Oh.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:38.150
My dad's gonna get me a job at 
a local bank, it looks like.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:42.820
Oh no! Why don't you worry about 
yourself instead of someone else?

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:46.230
You're not trying to take advantage of 
your skills as someone who's lived overseas.

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:48.330
I really want to kill you right now.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:53.280
I'm, well, you know... Tanaka-san 
will pay for everything I need.

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:57.460
Speaking of killing people, I think Tanaka 
would want to kill you for saying that.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:01.850
Anyway, there's still lots of fun to be had.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:05.320
First, take care of the borders for this.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:11.560
Even if she's new, this is pro level work!

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:17.050
I lose at having clear skin. 
I lose at drawing stuff...

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:20.320
But I can win at straight lines!

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:27.030
I'm sorry. I failed on my first try.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:30.530
I'll fix it. Don't worry. Show it to me.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:40.210
Yajimacchi! You're not coming to help today?

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:44.830
Nope. I don't think I'm helping when I go.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:46.320
Really?

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:50.650
Sempai was saying it would even help 
to have somebody do the erasing.

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:56.030
It takes a lot of strength. 
Anyway, Hato is just too perfect!

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:59.400
She's got her drawing backgrounds already!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:03.790
She's cute, kind, good at 
judo, and she can draw.

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:05.620
It's not fair.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:09.360
She just makes me feel terrible.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.470
She has a dong, though.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:14.870
Well, that's not fair, either.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:18.700
You saw it that one time, didn't 
you? How was it? Huge?

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:20.970
I told you I didn't see it!

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:24.920
You're lying! I flipped it up 
really hard! You had to see it!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.150
I looked away! I didn't see anything!

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:30.510
Hey there. What circle are you guys with?

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.200
Um...

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.720
Genshiken, why?

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:38.440
Then is the girl with the long brown 
hair I see with you in the same circle?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.900
What's her name?

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.200
My name?

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.480
Who are you?

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.750
It's me, Hato.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:51.440
The long wig gets in the way, so I switch 
it with a short one when I'm drawing.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.460
Shall we take a break?

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:57.940
So anyway, people are talking about you.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:01.960
A mysterious beautiful girl who only 
appears in the circle wing after school.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:07.920
I said you were in a different circle and I 
didn't know your name, but he was persistent.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:12.590
Yabusaki-sempai from the Manga Research Club 
happened to be passing by, and she drove him off.

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:15.310
Hey, what the hell do you think you're doing?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:18.400
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:21.120
No. It's nothing you need to apologize for.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.020
I'll send a message thanking 
her-- Wow, that was fast.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.520
I guess you could change 
your wig like that, though.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.240
Or maybe go for plainer clothes and makeup.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:34.390
I could, yes. I just always 
put a lot of effort into it.

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:37.510
If I don't, I don't feel 
like I can be a girl.

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:40.660
Really? You could pass 
for one without makeup.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:43.450
You could just stop cross-dressing.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.910
I hate to keep repeating it.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:55.760
But if you didn't dress like that, men
wouldn't pay any attention to you, right?

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:58.310
Well, that's true...

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:02.250
Listen, why are you so obsessed 
with cross-dressing, anyway?

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:06.860
Ohno-sempai seemed fine with 
it, but I don't get it.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.900
Would you put it in terms 
that even I could understand?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.700
Kuchiki-sempai's not here today.

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:17.160
Well... you're right.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.250
I dress this way to come to Genshiken.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:24.130
And I've only been doing 
it for about six months.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:28.170
Well... to put it simply...

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:33.740
In high school, when I came out 
and said I really enjoyed BL,

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:37.180
things were pretty rough for me.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:39.260
Pretty rough?

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:41.930
My school didn't have a Manga Club.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:46.240
The Art Club was what we had, 
so that's what I joined.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:50.500
I never told anybody I liked BL.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:54.070
But I wanted to talk with friends 
who shared the same interests.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.520
So I talked to the rotten 
girls in the club.

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:58.220
I'm sorry! That's enough.

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:01.520
I'm sorry, really. Maybe 
I shouldn't have said that.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:04.840
I mean, I shouldn't have 
said that. I'm sorry.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:05.960
It's fine.

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:10.080
I'm sorry, Ogiue-sempai. I ruined 
the mood. I'm really sorry.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:14.550
No, no... anyway, I guess that's enough.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:17.010
Let's get back to work.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.890
I'm going to clean up.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.360
I'm a horrible person.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:29.940
I got jealous and complained, and tried to 
make her say something she didn't want to say.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:34.360
Basically, she was bullied, right?

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:38.740
If her life was made miserable because of 
her interests, of course she cross-dresses.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:44.650
Wait, Hato. Sorry, I'm not done.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:48.660
We know you're into boy's love.

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:52.800
So we won't hassle you for 
it. We won't do anything.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:56.130
So you don't need to force 
yourself to dress like that.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:18:00.220
Yeah... you're right.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.470
Huh? That's it?

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:07.230
Yajimacchi, why don't you get it?

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.690
Get what?

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:13.320
Why doesn't she stop dressing like a girl?

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.440
Because she likes it!

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:18.550
Every guy wants to be a girl at least once!

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:21.280
Gender-bending is all the rage these days!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:21.910
Huh?

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:27.010
Especially since she's such a 
cute girl... she can't stop now!

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:30.660
Trauma won't keep you 
doing something forever.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:33.250
Really?

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:38.390
Well, um... it wasn't like that at first.

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:42.310
But I think that's part of it now.

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:46.140
It's not something I've always 
wanted to do. Really!

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.540
Then why not stop right now!

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:52.560
Do you realize how many problems your
beauty causes for the people around you?

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.700
I'm not beautiful!

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:56.470
Don't deny it! That makes it worse!

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:57.530
No problem. Everything's fine.  {Reference to the opening of El-Shaddai.}

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:02.230
Wait! That's... that's not all!

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:03.370
What?

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:08.730
It's not just that it's fun, 
or that I was bullied.

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.800
Since I started crossdressing,

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:14.960
I was able to see myself and 
my situation from the outside.

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:18.580
That sounds interesting.

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:24.160
Like... I got the key to 
Madarame-sempai's house, right?

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:29.020
Imagine a boy getting the key to his sempai's 
room, so he can use it to dress like a girl.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:32.230
When you look at that 
situation, it's basically...

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:37.320
Hato x Mada, right?

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:42.660
Let's get to work. Sempai, which 
one did you want me to erase?

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.460
Oh, here.

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:45.970
W-Why?

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:49.090
Shut up. You're not ever gonna 
stop cross-dressing, are you?

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.470
See you later, guys!

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:56.560
Bye.

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:58.450
Thanks again.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.730
Hato-chan's amazing. She 
says she's gonna keep at it.

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:09.310
Well, Susie's never leaving Sempai's 
side. Nothing weird will happen.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.060
What?

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:17.150
Yajimacchi, Hato-chan is always 
going to be a guy to you, isn't she?

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.960
Maybe, yeah.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:24.670
She totally looks like a girl.

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:28.330
But for some reason, I just see her as a guy.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:29.700
Why, I wonder?

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.620
Isn't it because...

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:35.910
The contents of her skirt 
are seared into your memory?

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.120
You're still talking about that?

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.910
Now tell me!

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.410
I didn't see!

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:42.480
Don't lie to me!

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:44.620
You're leaving already?

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:46.020
Ohno-sempai?

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:51.480
I had to fit it in with Tanaka-san and 
Kugayama-san's schedules, so it took a long time,

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:54.100
but we're ready for cosplay.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:21:00.820
Ogiue-san's place has two rooms, 
so it's perfect for changing.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.900
I was waiting for everybody to be here!

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:07.210
He joined the same year me and Madarame did.

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:10.570
I'm Kugayama. Hi.

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:11.580
Hello there.

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:15.710
Come on, Ogiue-san! It's time 
for after-school cosplay!

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:17.580
I'm working!

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.040
Sempai?

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:25.510
Even if she's nicer now, I 
still thought this would happen.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:29.350
We were right to not start moving the boxes.

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:13.200
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:14.940
So you did see up 
Hato-chan's skirt, Yajimacchi!

00:23:14.940 --> 00:23:17.330
I said I didn't!

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:19.810
We've got the video footage!

00:23:19.810 --> 00:23:22.670
It shows the skirt flying up, and 
your reaction when you saw it!

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:23.420
What are you talking about?

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:27.540
Now what was it? White? Black? 
Lace? G-string? Bloomers?

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:30.200
Or was it everybody's favorite, striped?

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:32.530
Shut up! It was more normal.

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:34.100
So you did see!

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:40.020
Next time on <i>Genshiken: Second 
Generation</i>: Daydream Believer.
